Package: SexSeek
Title: Estimate Genetic Sex from Expression Counts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Saket", "Choudhary", email = "saketc@iitb.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5202-7633"))
Description: Infers the genetic sex of samples, donors or cells from bulk or
    single-cell RNA sequencing counts. Accepts dense or sparse 
    matrices, delimited text files, 10x Genomics outputs, and 'Seurat', 
    'SingleCellExperiment' and 'SummarizedExperiment' objects.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/saketlab/SexSeek
